          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{\u2032}(t)=x(t)-2y(t) \\\\ {y}^{\u2032}(t)={y}^{2}(t)-x(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFind all equilibrium points of the system of differential equations above.",
